    {
      "template_id": "lesson_part_cover",
      "color_scheme": "dark",
      "content": {
        "image": {
          "src": "https://sehseadata.blob.core.windows.net/images/Photos/Module_5/M5_C3_L1_12.png",
          "caption": ""
        },
        "intro": "M4：公平能源转型融资",
        "title": "B：能源投资中的地理差异"
      }
    },
    {
      "template_id": "text",
      "color_scheme": "light",
      "content": {
        "text_elements": [
          {
            "template_id": "paragraph_medium",
            "content": {
              "text": "当今世界正经历着加快能源投资的强劲势头，新兴市场和发展中经济体（EMDEs）迫切需要增加对可再生能源的外部投资，以实现其可持续发展目标（SDGs）并向更清洁的能源未来转型。 [needs translation] <br /><br />According to UNCTAD and IEA, EMDEs need between <a href=\"https://unctad.org/press-material/unctad-calls-urgent-support-developing-countries-attract-massive-investment-clean#:~:text=in%20clean%20energy-,UNCTAD%20calls%20for%20urgent%20support%20to%20developing%20countries,massive%20investment%20in%20clean%20energy&text=Developing%20countries%20need%20renewable%20energy,only%20%24544%20billion%20in%202022.\"><u>$1.7 trillion</u></a> and <a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/scaling-up-private-finance-for-clean-energy-in-emerging-and-developing-economies/executive-summary\"><u>$2.8 trillion annually</u></a> for clean energy investments each year in renewable and clean energy investments to cover the necessities such as solar PVs, wind, power grids and storage. <br /><br />为了实现这一目标，年度投资必须从<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/scaling-up-private-finance-for-clean-energy-in-emerging-and-developing-economies/executive-summary\"><u>2022年的7700亿美元增加到2030年代初的2.2–2.8万亿美元</u></a>。 [needs translation] If China is excluded, the investment gap widens further, requiring annual investment to increase from USD 260 billion to as much as USD 1.4–1.9 trillion—<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/scaling-up-private-finance-for-clean-energy-in-emerging-and-developing-economies/executive-summary\"><u>a nearly sevenfold increase.</u></a> <br /><br />In 2024, EMDEs outside China account for only around 15% of global clean energy investment (<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/world-energy-investment-2024/overview-and-key-findings\"><u>IEA, 2024</u></a>). 例如，撒哈拉以南非洲在2000年至2024年间仅获得了全球投资总额的2%，大部分投资流向南非、肯尼亚、乌干达和赞比亚。 <br /><br />可再生能源投资差距也反映在不同地区的人均投资差异中。 全球清洁能源投资正在增加，但大部分增长集中在少数几个国家和地区。"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
